{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1031{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fprq2\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red255\green136\blue17;\red128\green128\blue128;\red0\green116\blue232;}
{\*\generator Msftedit 5.41.21.2508;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa80\sl264\slmult1\cf1\lang2055\f0\fs18\u9658? Lehmanns Online Specialty Bookstore \par
\cf2 Lehmanns is a bookstore and publisher with several stores in Germany. Their  focus is on scientific literature, especially for Human Medicine, Informatics, Veterinary Medicine, Natural Sciences, Engineering, Economics and Law.\par
\pard\sa80\sl264\slmult1\qr\cf3 http://www.lob.de\par
}

column3:
{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1031{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fprq2\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red255\green136\blue17;\red128\green128\blue128;\red0\green116\blue232;}
{\*\generator Msftedit 5.41.21.2508;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa80\sl264\slmult1\cf1\lang2055\f0\fs18\u9658? Lehmanns 在线专业书店 \par
\cf2 Lehmanns 是一家在德国拥有多家门店的书店和出版商。他们专注于科学文献，尤其是人类医学、信息学、兽医学、自然科学、工程学、经济学和法律。\par
\pard\sa80\sl264\slmult1\qr\cf3 http://www.lob.de\par
}

