{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
{\*\generator Msftedit 5.41.21.2508;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa80\sl264\slmult1\cf1\lang2055\f0\fs18 This license allows you to use the all the Citavi for Windows features until the expiration date shown. After this date, the site license will expire. As long as your organization extends the license agreement on time, you will be able to continue using Citavi for Windows. If your organization renews its license agreement, you will receive a new license key by email or can request one from the Citavi website. \par
If your organization does not renew its license agreement, or if you leave the organization, you can <a href="CampusLinkWithParameter">purchase a personal license key at the reduced upgrade price</a>. All of your project information will be preserved.\par
If you have already purchased a personal license, click <a fref="EnterLicenseKey">Enter License Key\'85</a>\par
}

column3:
